\;\Longrightarrow\;
M_{Z'}\;\gtrsim\;
\sqrt{\frac{|V_{ts}\,g_q\,g_\ell|}{3\times10^{-10}}}\; .
\tag{2}
\]

the present measurement \(\mathcal B(B_s\!	o\mu^{+}\mu^{-}) = (3.0\pm0.4)	imes10^{-9}\) therefore imposes the same **order\-of\-magnitude** limit: |  oxed{\;
